### ==============================================================================
### Black Box API Testing (REST Client)
### Project: Inventaris Pakaian Web Monorepo (apps/backend)
### Focus: Input Validation, Contract Guards, 400 Bad Request vs 500 Server Error
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@testUserId = user-tester-uuid

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Health Check Endpoint
### Expected: 200 OK
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name healthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Unauthorized Access: Outgoing Transaction
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized (Security boundary verification)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name unauthorizedOutgoing
POST {{baseUrl}}/outgoing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "itemId": 1, "quantity": 10 }
  ]
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Invalid Data Type: String instead of Integer for Quantity
### Expected: 400 Bad Request (Must NOT crash with 500 Internal Server Error)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name invalidTypeQuantity
POST {{baseUrl}}/outgoing
Content-Type: application/json
x-test-user: {{testUserId}}

{
  "items": [
    { "itemId": 1, "quantity": "sepuluh_pcs_invalid" }
  ]
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Invalid Numerical Boundary: Negative Quantity
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name negativeQuantity
POST {{baseUrl}}/outgoing
Content-Type: application/json
x-test-user: {{testUserId}}

{
  "items": [
    { "itemId": 1, "quantity": -50 }
  ]
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Invalid Numerical Boundary: Zero Quantity
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name zeroQuantity
POST {{baseUrl}}/outgoing
Content-Type: application/json
x-test-user: {{testUserId}}

{
  "items": [
    { "itemId": 1, "quantity": 0 }
  ]
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Malformed Payload: Empty Items Array
### Expected: 400 Bad Request ("Daftar barang tidak boleh kosong")
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name emptyItemsArray
POST {{baseUrl}}/outgoing
Content-Type: application/json
x-test-user: {{testUserId}}

{
  "items": []
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Missing Required Fields on Create Item
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name missingItemFields
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
x-test-user: {{testUserId}}

{}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Warehouse Transfer: Exceeding Destination Capacity (Boundary)
### Expected: 400 Bad Request ("Kapasitas gudang tujuan tidak mencukupi")
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name transferCapacityExceeded
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
x-test-user: {{testUserId}}

{
  "itemId": 1,
  "sourceWarehouseId": 1,
  "destWarehouseId": 2,
  "quantity": 999999
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Warehouse Transfer: Same Source and Destination Warehouse
### Expected: 400 Bad Request ("Gudang asal dan tujuan tidak boleh sama")
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name transferSameWarehouse
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
x-test-user: {{testUserId}}

{
  "itemId": 1,
  "sourceWarehouseId": 1,
  "destWarehouseId": 1,
  "quantity": 10
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Dashboard Stats (Aggregated KPI)
### Expected: 200 OK with totalItems, totalStock, and warehouses array
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getDashboardStats
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Accept: application/json
x-test-user: {{testUserId}}
